{"reviewId": "25265077_85w2xmrDX", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "每代人（20-30 年出生 cohort）因成长环境、核心经历不同，形成统一的价值观、消费习惯和投资偏好，当这代人成为社会生产、消费、投资的主力时，他们的集体选择会推动经济、产业和资产价格形成长期趋势，而代际交替时，集体行为的切换就会触发康波周期的阶段更迭。简单说：康波不是 “经济规律自动运转”，而是 “一代人推着经济走，然后下一代人换个方向推”—— 代际更迭是 “换方向” 的核心开关。\n", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "康波的形成是人的集体行为的结果，而这种集体行为取决于人的代际更迭。", "range": "953-986", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "25265077_85w2xmrDX", "userVid": 25265077, "topics": [], "createTime": 1766148851, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 25265077, "name": "小才大用", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0018-mi_2Ts3TkxIQgYDosvFXRf4/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "小才大用", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 198, "likes": [{"userVid": 12434276, "name": "紫弦月", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epxmhZqIJeicooIN9LGSIcKRbMOpkhaekkYpxA21FgibgBFdUNmLUJLcvmkLHv4o9xn41C11XTfON5Q/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "紫弦月", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-50", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title": "阅读书籍", "levelIndex": 50}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "比如谷子经济", "reviewId": "25265077_85w2xmrDX", "commentId": "25265077_85w2xmrDX_c570659_86UHtnJ